***TIME_AND_RESOLUTION***
1d4             Total time [yr]
false           Resume from checkpoint [true/false] (Not possible for SPEC method)
1d2             Cooling output steps [yr]
1d2             Magnetic output steps [yr]
50              Number of the thermal cells in the meridional direction (kmax)
100             Number of the thermal cells in the radial direction (lmax)
***MAGNETIC_FIELD***
true            Magnetic field evolution [true/false] (ibevol)
1d2             Initial poloidal dipolar field at the pole [10^12 G] (bpolin)
1d3             Initial toroidal field maximum value [10^12 G] (btorin)
1               Initial magnetic field topology (bgeom): 1: crust-confined, 2: core-extended) - binit.f90
1               Number of initial poloidal multipoles
1d0             Relative weight of initial poloidal multipoles (phi(n)) [list of reals]
2               Number of initial toroidal multipoles
0d0 1d0         Relative weight of initial toroidal multipoles (psi(n)) [list of reals]
false           Calculate magnetic stresses [true/false]
***TEMPERATURE***
true            Evolution of temperature? [true/false]
0               Envelope model [0=heavy elements, 1=light elements, 2=Gudmundsson] (ienv)
1d0             Impurity parameter in the crust (Qimp)
1d2             Impurity parameter in the pasta phase (Qpasta)
***ADVANCED_PARAMETERS***
true            Use relativistic grid [true/false]
true            Enable/disable Hall effect [true/false]
1.d2            Initial temperature [10^8 K]
7               Superfluid model index for n crust [0=deactivate] (see superfluid.f)
12              Superfluid model index for n core [0=deactivate] (see superfluid.f)
8               Superfluid model index for p core [0=deactivate] (see superfluid.f)
0.1d0           Initial spin period [s]
***NUMERICAL_METHODS***
EULA            Magnetic advance method [EUL, EULA, RK4, AB4, AB4A, RK4, RK4V, SPEC]
0.5d0           Courant pre-factor in adaptive timestep (set=0 to fix timestep to dtb0)
0.001d0         Minimum magnetic timestep [yr] (dtb0)
ETOR_U          Scheme for Etor computation ["ETOR_U"pwind -default-, "ETOR_C"entered]
true            Enable Burgers' flux formulation for toroidal field advance [true/false]
0.001d0         Pre-coefficient of toroidal field hyper-resistivity